WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:08.750
Part sixteen: send stand sheets. Email the stand leads their stand link and printable sign-in sheet, early, or again.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.777
Send stand sheets is in Hub tools.

00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:13.610
Tap it.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:21.202
The Hub sends these on its own, a few hours before each stand opens. Use this to send early, or again.

00:00:21.402 --> 00:00:25.413
Each upcoming stand shows who it goes to, and whether it's been sent.

00:00:25.613 --> 00:00:30.137
A stand with no lead sends each worker their own time log link instead.

00:00:30.337 --> 00:00:34.740
Check the stands, tap Send the checked stand sheets, and tap again.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:36.487
Sent.

00:00:36.687 --> 00:00:39.000
The list shows them as sent.
